VLA Hand Loss

The project layout is inspired by expolrer/depth-process-model.
Bench2Dex evaluation integration targets https://github.com/Bench2Dex/Bench2Dex
at commit cf83e869e722c67f032d7db17ad0e628e248eee4.

The OpenPI-derived source under workspaces/architectures/pi05/overlay
retains its original copyright notices and Apache License 2.0.
Original upstream: https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi
The trained hand-branch, weighted-loss and checkpoint compatibility additions
are captured from the user's Bench2Dex training workspace.

Robot mapping files are redistributed as the compatibility overlay used by
these checkpoints. They do not contain robot assets, datasets or weights.
Keep the upstream Bench2Dex license with any full upstream checkout.

No model checkpoints, demonstration data, access credentials or complete
Python environments are part of this repository.
